            "descriptionTemplate": "<p>The dwarf battalion draws alchemical bombs, then hurls them at distant foes. This volley is a @Template[type:burst|distance:{2}] within {4} feet that deals @Damage[{0}[@item.flags.system.rulesSelections.bombingBarrage]|options:area-damage] damage with a @Check[reflex|dc:{1}|basic|options:area-effect] save. The damage is either acid, fire, or electricity damage, depending on which type of bombs the battalion used. When the dwarf battalion is reduced to 2 or fewer segments, this area decreases to a @Template[type:burst|distance:{3}].</p>",
            "originalDescription": "<p>The dwarf battalion draws alchemical bombs, then hurls them at distant foes. This volley is a @Template[type:burst|distance:10] within 60 feet that deals @Damage[3d6[@item.flags.system.rulesSelections.bombingBarrage]|options:area-damage] damage with a @Check[reflex|dc:21|basic|options:area-effect] save. The damage is either acid, fire, or electricity damage, depending on which type of bombs the battalion used. When the dwarf battalion is reduced to 2 or fewer segments, this area decreases to a @Template[type:burst|distance:5].</p>",
